{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在部分段落压缩了人物心理的因果过程，尤其S05、S10，X把为什么难受、为什么不敢回去交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确视觉层级，扫屏时容易先抓住人物此刻的处境和心理转折；感受文字又通过出现时机与音乐变化对应，不必一次处理所有信息，细节也比X更具体，尤其对旋律、节奏、音色和情绪变化的描写。X的优势是叙述完整，人物为什么矛盾、为什么犹豫交代得更充分，但右侧短词集中堆叠，容易变成同时阅读一份情绪清单。整体而言，Y更像一边听音乐一边逐渐看懂一个人的经历，而不只是读一段故事再看一组情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4fd58b84-424a-433e-b6ab-56cf206b35cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T162103537519Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:21:52.022325+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "971d941eb328ec75ca48b5b8bab4a923a695cd83a0f745dff0da58eafd962d27", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg